This repository contains two categories of material, licensed differently.

## Content (`content/`)

All translated works and associated metadata (works/authors/translators
registries) under the `content/` directory are licensed under the
**Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0
International License (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0)**.

You are free to:
- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format,
  for any purpose other than commercial use.

Under the following terms:
- **Attribution** — You must give appropriate credit to the original
  author and the translator, and provide a link to this license.
- **NonCommercial** — You may not use the material for commercial
  purposes.
- **NoDerivatives** — If you remix, transform, or build upon the
  material, you may not distribute the modified material.

No additional restrictions — you may not apply legal terms or
technological measures that legally restrict others from doing anything
the license permits.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/

This license covers the translation itself. It does not, and cannot,
grant any rights beyond what the original source text's own copyright
status allows — each work's source edition and its copyright/public
domain status is recorded in `content/works/*/description.md`
(`editions[].copyright_status`).

## Code (`scripts/`, `assets/`)

All build tooling and front-end assets are licensed under the **MIT
License**. See [`scripts/LICENSE`](scripts/LICENSE) for the full text.
